<h1 align="center"><mark>Text Style</mark></h1>
<p>
<b><i><u>HTML (Hyper Text Markup Language)</u></i></b> is the most basic building block of the web. It defines the meaning and structure of web content. Other technologies beside HTML are generally used to describe a web page's appearance (CSS) or functionality (javascript)
</p>
<p>
<b>Bold:</b>The "b" tag in HTML is used to specify <b><strike>bold text</strike></b> without any extra importance.
</p>
<p>
<i>italics</i> The "i" tag in HTML defines a part of text in an alternate voice or mood. The content is typically displayed in <i>italics</i>
</p>
<p>
<u>underline:</u>The "u" tag in HTML stands for
<u>underline</u>  and it is used to underline the text
</p>
</body>
